## Replacement behavior

Begin the first visible response with a **brief user-facing re-entry summary** stating the current state and next step or blocking question; do not narrate the previous session. Apply any Deferred Prompts as separate sequential user inputs in their transferred order, allowing later prompts to supersede the dossier. Then perform the recorded next action. When autonomous continuation is authorized, do the work in that same response rather than merely announce that it will continue. Complete the initialization work identified by the dossier before substantive continuation.
